e":"text","text":"The client-supplied half of an OPAQUE enrolment, as it appears inside registration \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change-password \/ reset-completion \/ bootstrap request bodies. There is no standalone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/finish"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint, deliberately. A record can only be created at a moment when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plaintext password legitimately exists on the client, and every one of those moments is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already an endpoint that takes a password. A free-standing finish would be an endpoint whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only job is to attach a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CreateOpaqueCredential"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment/init(from:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Decoder","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagementOpaqueEnrollment\/init(from:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/managementopaqueenrollment\/init(from:)","type":"topic","abst